  "notes": "The lighthouse building at Split Rock in June 2012, including the buff octagonal tower, glass lantern, gallery, cleaning room and short connecting passage. The separately mapped fog signal house, keepers’ houses and visitor center are distinct structures. The native outline only covers the shaft. The attached cleaning room and short passage follow the construction section and the public exterior photo."
